            "text": "<p><em>The ultimate RAM 2500 6th Gen GVM package — race-bred suspension technology combined with Australia's highest legal GVM rating for this platform.</em></p><ul><li><strong>GVM Rating:</strong> TBC kg (see specification table) | <strong>GCM:</strong> TBC kg</li><li><strong>Key Features:</strong> Fox 3.0 Internal Bypass Race Series shocks (front &amp; rear), ORI 400kg heavy-duty leaf packs, load-rated wheels and tyres required.</li><li><strong>Best For:</strong> Serious enthusiasts or working professionals who demand race-bred damping technology, maximum legal payload, and full towing capacity — all in one completely compliant package.</li><li><strong>The Benefit:</strong> Fox 3.0 Bypass shocks offer unparalleled heat dissipation and damping control over the longest, hardest corrugated roads Australia can throw at you. This is the ultimate go-anywhere RAM 2500 setup that remains 100% legally compliant in every state.</li><li><strong>NOTE:</strong> Load-rated wheels and tyres required. Contact our team to discuss wheel and tyre options.</li></ul>"
